   "title": "Embedded Systems: Real-Time Interfacing to ARM Cortex-M Microcontrollers (Volume 2, 4th ed.)",
   "by": "Jonathan W. Valvano, University of Texas at Austin",
   "year": 2014,
   "url": "http://users.ece.utexas.edu/~valvano/arm/outline.htm",
   "toc_urls": [
    "http://users.ece.utexas.edu/~valvano/arm/TOC.pdf"
   ],
   "why": "节点“现有英文学习资源”是 MIT 6.071J（电子学与测量），主体是线性电路（KVL/KCL、戴维南、BJT），没有总线、执行器与软硬件接口的章节，目录和节点对不上，所以换成这本书：作者主页公开的目录 PDF 细到小节，覆盖硬件软件同步（时序、边沿触发、盲周期、握手）、定时接口（输入捕获、PWM、执行器、电机控制）、串行总线（RS232/RS485、SSI、I2C、USB）、模拟接口（运放、滤波、DAC/ADC）、系统级设计（功耗、容差、可测性）和数据采集（转导器、噪声分析）。"
  },
  {
   "key": "B",
   "kind": "course",
   "title": "6.071J Introduction to Electronics, Signals, and Measurement",
   "by": "David Cory, Ian Hutchinson, Manos Chaniotakis, MIT OpenCourseWare",
   "year": 2006,
   "url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-071j-introduction-to-electronics-signals-and-measurement-spring-2006/",
   "toc_urls": [
    "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-071j-introduction-to-electronics-signals-and-measurement-spring-2006/pages/calendar/"
   ],
   "why": "补“测量”“采集”“校准”：这就是节点给的现有资源，只用它和测量有关的部分（转导器、采样与混叠、滤波与运放、控制基础），以及唯一涉及标定的那次实验（测电阻温度系数）。"
  }
 ],
